### Rode antes o login em 01-auth.http (salva {{token}}).

### Cadastrar idoso (cria 6 perguntas sugeridas e uma agenda desligada)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/elderly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria da Silva",
  "preferredName": "Dona Maria",
  "phoneNumber": "(11) 98765-4321",
  "timezone": "America/Sao_Paulo",
  "notes": "Usa aparelho auditivo no ouvido esquerdo"
}

> {% client.global.set("elderlyId", response.body.id); %}

### Listar idosos (admin vê todos; tutor, só os seus)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/elderly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/elderly/{{elderlyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar (substitui o cadastro inteiro)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/elderly/{{elderlyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria da Silva",
  "preferredName": "Dona Maria",
  "phoneNumber": "+55 11 98765-4321",
  "timezone": "America/Sao_Paulo",
  "active": true
}

### Declarar consentimento de gravação (sem ele o agendador não liga)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/elderly/{{elderlyId}}/consent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "recordingConsent": true }

### Agenda
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/elderly/{{elderlyId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ativar agenda (horário no fuso do idoso)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/elderly/{{elderlyId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "localTime": "09:30",
  "daysOfWeek": ["MONDAY", "TUESDAY", "WEDNESDAY", "THURSDAY", "FRIDAY"],
  "active": true,
  "maxAttempts": 3,
  "retryIntervalMinutes": 20
}

### Questionário
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/elderly/{{elderlyId}}/questionnaire
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Substituir o questionário (a ordem da lista é a ordem das perguntas; máx. 12)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/elderly/{{elderlyId}}/questionnaire
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "attributeKey": "sleep", "questionText": "Como dormiu esta noite?", "answerType": "FREE_TEXT" },
  { "attributeKey": "medication", "questionText": "Tomou os remédios de hoje?", "answerType": "YES_NO" },
  { "attributeKey": "pain", "questionText": "Sente dor? De 1 a 5, quanto?", "answerType": "SCALE_1_5" },
  { "attributeKey": "water", "questionText": "Bebeu água hoje?", "answerType": "YES_NO", "active": false }
]

### Excluir definitivamente (LGPD) — apaga agenda, perguntas, ligações e áudios
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/elderly/{{elderlyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
